{"scope":"rt-31685c2dbb","css":".rt-31685c2dbb p.MsoNormal, .rt-31685c2dbb li.MsoNormal, .rt-31685c2dbb div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-31685c2dbb p.MsoPlainText, .rt-31685c2dbb li.MsoPlainText, .rt-31685c2dbb div.MsoPlainText {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-31685c2dbb div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-52px;\r\ntop:18px;width:994px;height:20px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>DEPARTMENT OF RADIOLOGY\r\n&amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>RADIOGRAPH OF\r\nRIGHT\/LEFT FOOT AP\/OBL<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n------Bones are within normal limits.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n------No obvious bony injury seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n------All joint spaces are preserved. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n------Digitogram reveals no definite recent bony trauma <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nnoted in the left\/right foot.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nSuggest clinical correlation. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u0